      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts armed men in military-style gear, with overlaid text claiming they kill gay people and women who go out in public without a male relative, and are supported by democrats and liberals. This is a hateful meme that targets specific groups (LGBTQ+ individuals and women) by associating them with violence and portraying them as victims of a group that is falsely and maliciously depicted as being supported by Western political ideologies. The meme uses dehumanizing and false equivalencies to incite fear and hatred toward these communities, fitting the definition of hateful content as it directly attacks individuals based on protected characteristics (sexual orientation and gender).",
